---
// src/components/PersonalitySection.astro
---

<section class="personality-section">
    <div class="horizontal-track">
        <!-- Panel 1: Web Development -->
        <div class="panel panel--1">
            <div class="panel__content">
                <span class="panel__number">01</span>
                <h2 class="panel__title">Web Development</h2>
                <p class="panel__text">
                    I’m still growing as a web developer, but I love the process
                    of figuring out how things work. I pay close attention to
                    small details — structure, spacing, clarity — and I enjoy
                    turning messy ideas into clean, thoughtful interfaces. Every
                    project teaches me something new, and that’s what keeps me
                    excited about the web.
                </p>
                <div class="panel__tags">
                    <span class="tag">Astro</span>
                    <span class="tag">React</span>
                    <span class="tag">TypeScript</span>
                    <span class="tag">GSAP</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Panel 2: Visual Design -->
        <div class="panel panel--2">
            <div class="panel__content">
                <span class="panel__number">02</span>
                <h2 class="panel__title">Visual Design</h2>
                <p class="panel__text">
                    Design is where I feel most at home. I’m naturally drawn to
                    composition, micro-details, and creating visuals that feel
                    balanced and intentional. I love shaping a story through
                    color, layout, and typography — making sure every element
                    earns its place.
                </p>
                <div class="panel__tags">
                    <span class="tag">Figma</span>
                    <span class="tag">Typography</span>
                    <span class="tag">Color Theory</span>
                    <span class="tag">Branding</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Panel 3: UX Research -->
        <div class="panel panel--3">
            <div class="panel__content">
                <span class="panel__number">03</span>
                <h2 class="panel__title">UX Research</h2>
                <p class="panel__text">
                    I’m the kind of person who notices patterns in how people
                    behave. UX research lets me turn that curiosity into
                    something useful. Through observation, testing, and asking
                    honest questions, I try to understand what people actually
                    need — not just what we assume they need.
                </p>
                <div class="panel__tags">
                    <span class="tag">User Testing</span>
                    <span class="tag">Ethnography</span>
                    <span class="tag">Analytics</span>
                    <span class="tag">Personas</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Panel 4: Featured Work -->
        <div class="panel panel--4">
            <div class="panel__content">
                <span class="panel__number">04</span>
                <h2 class="panel__title">Let's Explore</h2>
                <p class="panel__text">
                     My projects combine everything I’m learning — design, research, and
                     development — into experiences that feel personal and purposeful. Take a
                    look below to see how I approach storytelling, detail, and creativity in my
                    work.
                </p>
                <div class="panel__cta">
                    <svg
                        class="arrow-down"
                        width="40"
                        height="40"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        fill="none"
                    >
                        <path
                            d="M12 5v14M5 12l7 7 7-7"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            stroke-width="2"
                            stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                    </svg>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Scroll indicator -->
    <div class="scroll-indicator">
        <span class="scroll-text">Scroll to explore</span>
        <div class="scroll-line"></div>
    </div>
</section>
